                {
                    "id": "689020602",
                    "speaker": "Tubby",
                    "text": "This Realm Within has clear and sunny skies all year round. It's not that it can't reproduce the weather outside, I simply enjoy dozing off in the sun."
                },
                {
                    "id": "689020603",
                    "speaker": "Tubby",
                    "text": "The sunlight after lunch is so warm and comfortable."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
